WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.560
Episode 99

2
00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:02.340
What's up?

3
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:03.140
What are you looking at?

4
00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:03.940
You seem quite serious.

5
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:05.840
Hey, do you have something on your mind recently?

6
00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:06.660
No, I don't.

7
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:08.400
It's you who has something on your mind.

8
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:22.480
I'd like to book a room.

9
00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:23.540
Okay.

10
00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:28.840
Mrs. Bradley, I have

11
00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:30.140
already processed it for you.

12
00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:31.600
It's the room you usually stay in at the hotel.

13
00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:33.720
Mrs. Bradley?

14
00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:36.740
Oh, I accidentally used Niko's card.

15
00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:38.120
Thank you.

16
00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:44.980
Oh.

17
00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:47.320
Hey, hey, hey.

18
00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:51.080
Noemi,

19
00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:53.600
why didn't you reply to my messages?

20
00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:54.480
Huh?

21
00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:02.140
Didn't have anything on your mind? You're wasted
now.

22
00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:03.840
Let me take you home.

23
00:01:04.180 --> 00:01:05.180
Well, I'll take you to the hotel,

24
00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:07.420
the one you usually stay in.

25
00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:14.320
Who is it?

26
00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:20.100
Niko,

27
00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:23.580
Niko,

28
00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:24.340
what are you doing?

29
00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:26.060
You,

30
00:01:26.740 --> 00:01:28.000
Noemi,

31
00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:29.720
why didn't you reply to my messages?

32
00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:31.860
You already finds a new love,

33
00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:32.880
so why should I reply to your messages?

34
00:01:33.120 --> 00:01:34.800
When did I have a new love?

35
00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:36.500
Huh?

36
00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:38.700
Noemi,

37
00:01:40.140 --> 00:01:41.360
I miss you so much.
